---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import { site } from '../config';
const downloads = [
  {name:'Windows', platform:'Windows 10/11 · x64', url:site.windowsDownload},
  {name:'Mac — Apple Silicon', platform:'Mac with M1, M2, M3 or newer Apple chip', url:site.macArmDownload},
  {name:'Mac — Intel', platform:'Mac with an Intel processor', url:site.macIntelDownload},
];
---
<Layout title="Download Equipnivo | Windows & Mac trial" description="Download Equipnivo 1.0.2 for Windows or Mac. Try maintenance tracking with 10 active equipment items, unlimited staff and local network access.">
<section class="wrap section"><p class="eyebrow">EQUIPNIVO / GETTING STARTED</p><h1 class="page-title">Your first ten items.<br />A proper workshop trial.</h1><p class="lead narrow">Test equipment maintenance software with your real people, real checks and real equipment before buying.</p>
{downloads.map(download => <div class="download-panel"><div><p class="eyebrow">{download.platform}</p><h2>{download.name}</h2><p>Version {site.downloadVersion}. Install on the computer that will host Equipnivo.</p><p><a href={`${download.url}.sha256`}>SHA-256 checksum</a></p></div><a class="button primary" href={download.url!}>Download for {download.name} ↓</a></div>)}
<p class="narrow">These installers are unsigned test builds. The Mac packages are not notarized. Both Mac application packages passed local checks; Windows installation, upgrade, network settings and uninstall passed on a clean Windows runner.</p>
<div class="two-columns"><article><h2>What’s in the trial?</h2><ul class="ticks"><li>Maximum 10 active equipment items</li><li>Unlimited people and personal PINs</li><li>Recurring maintenance and equipment checklists</li><li>Passed, problem found and unable-to-check outcomes</li><li>Fault reports and attributed completion history</li><li>Optional local network access for staff devices</li></ul><p>At the limit, your existing records remain usable. Activate a paid licence to add more equipment.</p></article><article><h2>Install and get started</h2><ol class="steps"><li>Install the version for your main computer. On Windows, open Equipnivo from the Start menu. On Mac, open Equipnivo from Applications.</li><li>Create your first Admin name and personal PIN.</li><li>Add equipment and recurring maintenance checklists.</li><li>Add Staff PINs from Settings.</li><li>On the main computer, choose <strong>Settings → Network access → Enable network access</strong> to allow staff devices. Open the displayed address on the same trusted private network. Firewall settings may also need to allow Equipnivo.</li></ol><p>The installers include the .NET runtime. Keep the main computer on while staff use Equipnivo. Back up your local data regularly. Do not expose Equipnivo directly to the internet.</p><p>When a check reveals a problem or cannot be performed, record its outcome and explanation, then finish the inspection. Equipnivo saves the explanation in history and creates an open fault report.</p></article></div><div class="help-bar"><div><h3>Ready to unlock unlimited equipment?</h3><p>£79 once. Unlimited staff. All 1.x updates.</p></div><a class="button primary" href={site.checkout}>Buy Equipnivo · £79 ↗</a><a href="/licence-help/">Licence help →</a></div></section>
</Layout>
